WEBVTT

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:35.375
<i>Have you ever</i>
<i>had a dream like mine?</i>

00:00:37.417 --> 00:00:41.708
<i>There's a girl, who I've</i>
<i>never met before, next to me,</i>

00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:46.083
<i>and I love her, </i>

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:50.292
<i>and she loves me.</i>

00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:57.667
<i>But... always, when it ends...</i>

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.708
<i>the girl is taken away</i>
<i>by the sky, and I wake up.</i>

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:19.542
Good day, ladies and gentlemen.
My name is Sugata Eishiro.

00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:22.375
This is my assistant, Pretty.

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:27.208
Take a look at this.
There is a mysterious hole,

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.208
which moves around
above the earth's surface.

00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:33.083
All kinds of scientists have
conducted research to identify it,

00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:36.458
and they have even launched
observational probes into it,

00:01:36.458 --> 00:01:38.833
but they have been unable
to reach any conclusions.

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:42.583
Of course, those are no more
than reality-based theories.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:47.208
As you are aware, Columbus,
who discovered the American continent,

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:50.375
showed how to stand an egg on
end by looking at the problem differently.

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:53.083
Unreality...

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:56.667
is what no one else can believe,
until they see it in reality.

00:01:57.667 --> 00:02:03.000
Much like what is beneath a
woman's skirt, it is an unknown world.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.667
However, I am able to see it.

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:08.167
The key word that connects everything--

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:10.167
The New World!

00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:15.042
Now then, the next question is
of the actual state of the New World,

00:02:15.042 --> 00:02:17.750
or metaphorically speaking,
what is inside the panties--

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.958
"A Full-frontal Hero Arises in the World!"

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.250
Tomo,

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.708
wake up!

00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:28.333
Wake up! You're going to be late.

00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:30.125
Just a little longer...

00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:33.125
Aw, geez... No, you can't!

00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:38.667
What's the matter, Sohara?!

00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:45.083
It's like a tea stalk sticking up.

00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:48.500
I'm going to have good luck
from the morning onward, Sohara.

00:03:03.417 --> 00:03:05.750
Here, at least drink your milk.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.458
Thank you.

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:09.917
Your necktie is crooked.

00:03:09.917 --> 00:03:13.792
No matter how old you get,
you're still just a child.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.875
Off I go.

00:03:19.292 --> 00:03:21.625
<i>The town of Sorami, where we live,</i>

00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:26.917
<i>is a small town of about 7000,</i>
<i>surrounded by mountains.</i>

00:03:26.917 --> 00:03:29.625
<i>It isn't particularly known for anything,</i>

00:03:29.625 --> 00:03:33.542
<i>and about all it has are</i>
<i>the smiles of its old lady farmers,</i>

00:03:33.542 --> 00:03:38.375
<i>and its large, over-400-year-old cherry tree.</i>

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:44.875
<i>Everyone says there's nothing here,</i>

00:03:44.875 --> 00:03:47.208
<i>but I love this town. </i>

00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:48.292
<i>--"Nothing beats peace and quiet."</i>
<i>That's my motto.</i>

00:03:48.292 --> 00:03:51.500
--Don't fall asleep!
<i>--"Nothing beats peace and quiet." That's my motto.</i>

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:56.000
<i>Watching TV, eating my meals,</i>
<i>and napping during classtime--</i>

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.708
<i>"Nothing beats peace and quiet," does it?</i>

00:04:01.542 --> 00:04:04.125
Help me...

00:04:04.125 --> 00:04:07.125
I'm trapped by the sky.

00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:11.792
I'm trapped by the sky.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:13.708
Tomo...!

00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:18.250
Tomo, wake up! Class is over!

00:04:23.375 --> 00:04:25.958
You had that dream again, huh?

00:04:25.958 --> 00:04:28.083
Oh, not again.

00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:30.833
Say, Tomo,

00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:34.000
you've had the same dream,
ever since you were little, right?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.000
Maybe you should go
to the hospital, or something.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.333
I'm fine, I tell you. A hospital
would be making too much of it.

00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:40.542
Yeah, but...

00:04:40.542 --> 00:04:44.833
I know! What if we were to ask
our upperclassman, Sugata?

00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:48.083
No way, no way! I don't want to
get involved with that guy--

00:04:48.083 --> 00:04:49.458
he's like one big mass of trouble!

00:04:49.458 --> 00:04:51.542
They say there's a jumper
on the roof, causing a big fuss!

00:04:51.542 --> 00:04:52.875
You're kidding!

00:04:52.875 --> 00:04:54.500
A jumper?!

00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:56.958
There's plenty of wind,

00:04:56.958 --> 00:05:00.042
and while I'm not
entirely happy about its direction,

00:05:00.042 --> 00:05:02.042
it won't affect my takeoff.

00:05:02.042 --> 00:05:04.125
Stop! Don't do anything hasty!

00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:05.250
--That's that senior who's all crazy, right?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.250
--Student Council Chairman, afternoon.
--That's that senior who's all crazy, right?

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:07.667
--Yeah, the one from the "New World Discovery Club."

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:09.708
--Um, who is the jumper?
--Yeah, the one from the "New World Discovery Club."

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:10.833
He's up there.

00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:12.583
S-Sugata?

00:05:12.583 --> 00:05:14.292
Are you sure you shouldn't stop him?!

00:05:14.292 --> 00:05:16.667
He wouldn't listen to
me if I tried to stop him.

00:05:16.667 --> 00:05:18.333
I'll think about it once he falls.

00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:20.000
That's so irresponsible!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.625
Isn't there something you can
do as the student council chairman?

00:05:23.625 --> 00:05:25.958
Oh, but I've already bought insurance.

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.875
It pays a 100,000,000 yen death benefit.

00:05:28.875 --> 00:05:29.750
--Amazing!

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.667
--Hey, you, don't be impressed!
--Amazing!

00:05:31.667 --> 00:05:35.042
And Chairman, you've been
Sugata's friend since childhood!

00:05:35.042 --> 00:05:36.667
You should be more worried about him!

00:05:36.667 --> 00:05:39.042
I'm not worried about him,

00:05:39.042 --> 00:05:39.958
is that it?

00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:40.958
N-No, no...

00:05:40.958 --> 00:05:44.417
I'm watching Sugata plunge
to his death with a smile,

00:05:44.417 --> 00:05:47.417
thinking that cherry blossom
season isn't a bad time to die,

00:05:47.417 --> 00:05:49.375
is that what you're saying I'm thinking?

00:05:49.375 --> 00:05:50.833
No, I wouldn't...

00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:52.875
Once I get the insurance payout,

00:05:52.875 --> 00:05:54.542
I think I'll remember him

00:05:54.542 --> 00:05:57.625
by traveling the world on a luxury liner,

00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:59.750
is that what you're saying I'm thinking?

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:00.792
<i>Is </i>that what you're thinking?

00:06:00.792 --> 00:06:01.333
"General Insurance Certificate"

00:06:01.333 --> 00:06:04.167
Which do you think?
Would you like to know?

00:06:04.167 --> 00:06:05.583
No.

00:06:10.917 --> 00:06:11.625
--He's flying...

00:06:11.625 --> 00:06:13.042
--Be careful!
--He's flying...

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.292
Well, let's get back.

00:06:25.292 --> 00:06:27.375
Tomo, what about your dream?

00:06:27.375 --> 00:06:29.250
Not a chance in hell!

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.875
What are we talking about?

00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:34.167
There's something we'd
like to speak to Sugata about.

00:06:34.167 --> 00:06:37.292
I've heard that he
is quite knowledgeable.

00:06:37.292 --> 00:06:39.458
Yes, he is.

00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:44.292
He's kind of a maniacal, perverted,
oddball four-eyed swine,

00:06:44.292 --> 00:06:46.542
but I think you can turn to him.

00:06:46.542 --> 00:06:47.792
As if I would!

00:06:47.792 --> 00:06:49.875
But there's no one else
we can ask, is there?

00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:51.333
I'm worried about you.

00:06:51.333 --> 00:06:53.417
I just want to live in peace!

00:06:53.417 --> 00:06:56.042
Oh... all right.

00:07:01.667 --> 00:07:02.500
"New World Discovery Club"

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.208
I understand all that you're telling me.

00:07:05.208 --> 00:07:08.875
It is said that dreams are
the electrical signals that occur

00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:11.083
when the brain organizes its memories.

00:07:11.083 --> 00:07:15.042
In other words, your memories
and desires become your dreams.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:19.417
But that is nothing more
than a reality-based theory.

00:07:19.417 --> 00:07:23.125
And reality-based theories
cannot explain unreality.

00:07:23.125 --> 00:07:25.083
Look at this.

00:07:26.292 --> 00:07:27.917
Not this.

00:07:29.333 --> 00:07:30.917
Do you know what this is?

00:07:30.917 --> 00:07:32.125
No, not at all.

00:07:32.125 --> 00:07:34.125
You are correct.

00:07:34.125 --> 00:07:36.542
The conclusion is, "I don't know."

00:07:36.542 --> 00:07:39.208
Many scientists have researched it for years,

00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:41.083
but they don't know anything about it.

00:07:41.083 --> 00:07:45.500
However, I do know what this hole is,

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:49.167
not to mention, what your dream is.

00:07:49.167 --> 00:07:51.875
It is all a New World!

00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:53.333
Those in academic circles are all fools!

00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:55.167
It is displacing this much mass!

00:07:55.167 --> 00:07:58.583
It can only be considered a "New World,"
floating through the sky!

00:08:02.958 --> 00:08:06.417
The dreams you are having
are connected to this New World.

00:08:06.417 --> 00:08:09.708
--No! No! No! No! No! No! No! No!
--Believe you me, I will definitely find your dream!

00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:10.375
Cool!

00:08:10.375 --> 00:08:11.083
--Hey, Sohara, are you actually believing this claptrap?!

00:08:11.083 --> 00:08:14.833
--The New World will pass over town at exactly midnight tonight.
--Hey, Sohara, are you actually believing this claptrap?!

00:08:14.833 --> 00:08:15.500
--And don't you go egging her on!

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.542
--Would it be okay if I came with you?
--And don't you go egging her on!

00:08:17.542 --> 00:08:19.333
Of course.

00:08:19.333 --> 00:08:20.375
<i>This is bad. </i>

00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:23.375
<i>--I can hear the sound of my</i>
<i>peace and quiet starting to crumble.</i>

00:08:23.375 --> 00:08:25.208
--All right, we'll meet up tonight at 12 o'clock,
<i>--I can hear the sound of my peace and quiet starting to crumble.</i>

00:08:25.208 --> 00:08:27.500
at the big cherry tree next to the shrine.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:39.458
I'm sorry. My mom said
I couldn't go out that late.

00:08:39.458 --> 00:08:41.875
Mikako called me away this evening,

00:08:41.875 --> 00:08:44.125
so I'm sorry,
but I won't be able to make it.

00:08:45.667 --> 00:08:48.083
"Everyone said we should go, but..."

00:08:48.083 --> 00:08:48.917
"Huh?"

00:08:48.917 --> 00:08:51.125
"I'm the only one here."

00:08:51.125 --> 00:08:52.542
"--Tomoki"

00:08:55.792 --> 00:08:58.917
Give me a break! I'm going home!

00:09:00.167 --> 00:09:01.583
Sugata...

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.833
What is it, Sugata?

00:09:03.833 --> 00:09:06.083
Get away from there, right now!

00:09:06.083 --> 00:09:08.833
I checked the most recent data,
and something is wrong.

00:09:08.833 --> 00:09:10.625
There's a huge disturbance
right now, heading your...

00:09:10.625 --> 00:09:13.083
Huh? I didn't quite catch that.

00:09:13.083 --> 00:09:15.292
...hole is moving...

00:09:15.292 --> 00:09:17.250
...directly above you...

00:09:25.625 --> 00:09:27.625
W-What was that?!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.250
A-A person?!

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:37.583
No... it's not a person...

00:09:37.583 --> 00:09:42.292
People don't have
wings growing out of them!

00:09:46.542 --> 00:09:50.583
<i>Even so, this has the</i>
<i>strong stink of trouble!</i>

00:09:50.583 --> 00:09:52.125
Retreat!

00:09:57.292 --> 00:10:00.333
What is going on?!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:05.042
<i>She'll be all right.</i>
<i>She fell from the sky,</i>

00:10:05.042 --> 00:10:07.500
<i>but didn't have a scratch on her.</i>

00:10:08.583 --> 00:10:12.333
<i>I'm not getting involved in this.</i>
<i>Nothing beats peace and quiet.</i>

00:10:12.333 --> 00:10:13.958
<i>That's my...</i>

00:10:15.458 --> 00:10:17.750
<i>my motto...</i>

00:10:20.042 --> 00:10:23.042
Damn it all!

00:10:34.792 --> 00:10:38.917
I just want to live in peace and quiet!

00:10:38.917 --> 00:10:42.875
I'm gonna go home,
watch some TV, and go to bed!

00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:08.917
Commence imprinting.

00:11:13.917 --> 00:11:15.792
Wha--?

00:11:24.458 --> 00:11:26.500
I am pleased to meet you.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:30.208
I am a pet-type Angeloid.

00:11:31.917 --> 00:11:34.833
I will do anything to please you,

00:11:34.833 --> 00:11:36.667
my master.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:54.917
Tomo! I have day duty today,
so I'm going in early.

00:11:54.917 --> 00:11:57.542
Don't you be late, now.

00:12:00.292 --> 00:12:03.125
Good morning, Master.

00:12:10.625 --> 00:12:15.917
Come to think of it,
you fell out of the sky last night, huh?

00:12:15.917 --> 00:12:20.000
Master, please command me
to do whatever you would enjoy.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.458
You may ask for anything you want.

00:12:22.458 --> 00:12:28.292
We Angeloids were created
only to please our masters.

00:12:29.542 --> 00:12:32.125
A-Anything I want?

00:12:32.125 --> 00:12:33.833
Yes.

00:12:33.833 --> 00:12:35.292
Your b...

00:12:35.292 --> 00:12:36.708
My b...?

00:12:37.208 --> 00:12:39.250
B-Bundles of money, maybe?

00:12:40.458 --> 00:12:41.125
--Money, you say?

00:12:41.125 --> 00:12:44.583
<i>--That was close! I almost got the hots for this mythical being.</i>
--Money, you say?

00:12:44.583 --> 00:12:45.458
<i>--That was close! I almost got the hots for this mythical being.</i>
--Will one hundred billion do?

00:12:45.458 --> 00:12:47.667
--<i>Safe! I'm safe now!</i>
--Will one hundred billion do?

00:12:48.875 --> 00:12:53.250
Oh, sure. With that much,
I could buy anything I wanted, huh?

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:54.875
Transport.

00:13:11.708 --> 00:13:15.417
Seriously?! What is that
card-like thing you've got?

00:13:15.417 --> 00:13:16.833
Let me see, let me see!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:21.125
That card is what my
kind call a transport device.

00:13:21.125 --> 00:13:22.625
Transport device?

00:13:22.625 --> 00:13:24.625
It responds to my master's wishes,

00:13:24.625 --> 00:13:27.333
and sends for whatever equipment
is necessary from Synapse.

00:13:27.333 --> 00:13:28.833
Synapse?

00:13:28.833 --> 00:13:33.667
I have no information
within me about what Synapse is.

00:13:33.667 --> 00:13:36.792
I first awoke when I encountered you, Master.

00:13:37.667 --> 00:13:44.042
I am a pet-type Angeloid,
type Alpha, Ikaros.

00:13:44.042 --> 00:13:48.875
I am a product of Synapse,
created only to please my master.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:58.292
Well, never mind the hard questions.
So, what else can you do?

00:13:58.292 --> 00:13:59.708
Anything.

00:14:00.167 --> 00:14:01.750
Anything?!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.167
Yes.

00:14:07.292 --> 00:14:08.917
Come on...

00:14:09.708 --> 00:14:12.708
They've started to get even bigger, huh?

00:14:12.708 --> 00:14:13.208
I don't even want all of this.

00:14:13.208 --> 00:14:17.042
Awesome! Being invisible is awesome!

00:14:17.042 --> 00:14:18.958
Master, what is this?

00:14:18.958 --> 00:14:21.708
This is the dream of every man, Ikaros!

00:14:21.708 --> 00:14:26.333
For males, all roads
lead to just below the belt!

00:14:27.583 --> 00:14:30.000
Now then, for a little mischief...

00:14:38.917 --> 00:14:41.458
All right, I got her!

00:14:41.458 --> 00:14:43.333
Master, what was that?

00:14:43.333 --> 00:14:44.292
Payback!

00:14:44.292 --> 00:14:49.292
That was payback for that
strong-arm girl always chopping me!

00:14:49.292 --> 00:14:50.458
Payback?

00:14:50.458 --> 00:14:53.125
All right, onto the next place, Ikaros!

00:14:53.125 --> 00:14:54.542
Transport!

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.583
Time...

00:14:58.875 --> 00:15:00.292
stop!

00:15:08.667 --> 00:15:09.833
Master...?

00:15:09.833 --> 00:15:14.792
How about that?! Wherever I run is
my domain! The world is mine!

00:15:16.042 --> 00:15:18.000
Let's keep this going!

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:33.625
<i>I wonder what happened to Tomo.</i>

00:15:34.833 --> 00:15:37.500
I'm pulling my own "The World"!

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:41.042
I gotcha!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.167
How is it, Master?

00:15:53.333 --> 00:15:57.750
Outstanding, Ikaros! But how
on earth did you get the ingredients?

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.500
Yes, well, using the card,

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.917
I called for a quantum material
converter, then, using the air--

00:16:01.917 --> 00:16:04.583
Never mind, it's too complicated.

00:16:04.583 --> 00:16:06.917
Do you have any other orders?

00:16:07.917 --> 00:16:10.833
Any others... huh...?

00:16:13.833 --> 00:16:15.750
Strip... maybe?

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:17.167
Yes.

00:16:21.833 --> 00:16:22.792
Sorry! Sorry!

00:16:22.792 --> 00:16:26.542
Kidding! Kidding! Kidding!
Forget I said it!

00:16:26.542 --> 00:16:29.625
I cannot cancel an order.

00:16:29.625 --> 00:16:33.958
I was not created to do so.

00:16:34.958 --> 00:16:37.958
Do you have any other orders?

00:16:37.958 --> 00:16:39.292
No, no, no, no, no!

00:16:39.292 --> 00:16:44.000
That's all for today! I'm tired now.
We'll start again tomorrow.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.375
Then again, I've done everything I wanted to.

00:16:47.375 --> 00:16:51.417
Taking over the world is
about all that's left!

00:16:56.833 --> 00:16:59.000
Tomo, wake up!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.333
Why didn't you come to school yesterday?

00:17:01.333 --> 00:17:04.167
The teacher was unbelievably mad at you.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.000
--Geez, open up!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.708
--Yeah, all right.
--Geez, open up!

00:17:10.708 --> 00:17:12.708
Okay, okay...

00:17:12.708 --> 00:17:15.000
Huh? Sohara?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.833
What is this?

00:17:17.417 --> 00:17:21.958
Your takeover of the world
will be completed shortly, Master.

00:17:21.958 --> 00:17:25.583
I began running a world
domination program a moment ago.

00:17:26.833 --> 00:17:28.667
You don't mean...

00:17:30.792 --> 00:17:33.500
Following an investigation,
I concluded that there was no one

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:36.458
who would recognize you
as being their king, Master.

00:17:38.083 --> 00:17:39.500
As a result,

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:45.458
the program determined that all
living people should be eliminated.

00:17:45.458 --> 00:17:48.292
All living people...?

00:17:48.292 --> 00:17:49.708
Yes.

00:17:51.833 --> 00:17:53.167
Can you cancel it?

00:17:53.167 --> 00:17:57.625
I cannot. I was not created to do so.

00:18:04.875 --> 00:18:15.333
<i>I just wanted... to live a</i>
<i>normal life... of peace and quiet.</i>

00:18:24.458 --> 00:18:28.792
So everyone really is gone now.

00:18:28.792 --> 00:18:33.708
I am terribly sorry. I was sure
that you had given me an order.

00:18:35.375 --> 00:18:37.208
What would you like me to do?

00:18:37.208 --> 00:18:40.583
If you like, I can dispose of myself.

00:18:40.583 --> 00:18:45.167
Yeah... that would be most helpful.

00:18:46.625 --> 00:18:49.625
I've already had more than enough trouble.

00:18:56.292 --> 00:18:58.125
Yes, Master.

00:19:03.208 --> 00:19:04.708
Master?

00:19:05.417 --> 00:19:10.875
I'm kidding. I'm kidding.
Forget that last order, okay?

00:19:10.875 --> 00:19:12.792
I cannot cancel an order.

00:19:12.792 --> 00:19:14.625
Why not?!

00:19:14.625 --> 00:19:19.083
You haven't done anything wrong.
You were just following my order.

00:19:19.083 --> 00:19:22.875
So there's no reason
why you have to go away, too.

00:19:22.875 --> 00:19:24.708
But, I cannot cancel--

00:19:24.708 --> 00:19:29.042
Please! It's my fault
that everyone is gone!

00:19:29.042 --> 00:19:31.792
What should I do?!

00:19:31.792 --> 00:19:38.833
Don't leave me here by myself.
Please, cancel that order,

00:19:38.833 --> 00:19:41.875
and stay here, by my side.

00:19:49.833 --> 00:19:52.750
Yes, Master.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:58.542
I just wish this were all a bad dream.

00:20:00.625 --> 00:20:03.583
Take good care of the angel.

00:20:04.667 --> 00:20:07.250
Don't ever let her go.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:17.500
Tomo! I have day duty today,
so I'm going in early.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.500
Don't you be late, now.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:24.167
That was a dream?! Well? Was it really?!

00:20:24.167 --> 00:20:28.417
Whoa, that was dicey,
even for me. Is this for real?

00:20:28.417 --> 00:20:31.125
Good morning, Master.

00:20:31.125 --> 00:20:32.333
Is that...?

00:20:32.333 --> 00:20:35.417
Yes. You said you
wished that it were a dream,

00:20:35.417 --> 00:20:37.208
so I ran a program that made it a dream,

00:20:37.208 --> 00:20:39.458
and returned everything back to normal.

00:20:39.458 --> 00:20:41.333
You can do that?!

00:20:41.333 --> 00:20:43.250
Should I not have done that?

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:47.458
No, it's fine, it's fine!
Good job! Outstanding!

00:20:47.458 --> 00:20:49.083
But still...

00:20:50.375 --> 00:20:52.625
To be honest, I'm exhausted.

00:20:52.625 --> 00:20:58.083
Um, Master, did you wish for
me to keep that part a dream, too?

00:20:58.083 --> 00:21:00.333
Huh? What?

00:21:00.333 --> 00:21:04.958
When you said "stay here, by my side."

00:21:06.208 --> 00:21:10.208
Did you wish for that to
be part of the dream, too?

00:21:14.667 --> 00:21:19.292
Ikaros, you can do with
that whatever you like, right?

00:21:19.292 --> 00:21:20.792
What do you mean by...

00:21:20.792 --> 00:21:22.792
Just what I said!

00:21:33.875 --> 00:21:35.292
Yes...

00:21:37.458 --> 00:21:39.000
<i>I'll say it again.</i>

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:43.125
<i>All I want is to live a normal</i>
<i>life of peace and quiet.</i>

00:21:43.125 --> 00:21:47.958
<i>And yet, those who are around</i>
<i>me include a girl with a killer chop,</i>

00:21:47.958 --> 00:21:50.042
<i>a perv who flies through the air,</i>

00:21:50.042 --> 00:21:54.042
<i>and to top it all off,</i>
<i>Ikaros fell out of the sky that day.</i>

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.708
<i>This is how the days</i>
<i>that I will never forget began.</i>

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:10.625
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:22:16.458 --> 00:22:25.542
<i>When I whispered to the sky</i>

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:35.375
<i>You smiled beside me and answered</i>

00:22:36.583 --> 00:22:41.958
<i>Over and over, it echoes in my ears,</i>
<i>(Your gentle voice echoes in my ears)</i>

00:22:41.958 --> 00:22:50.042
<i>warm enough to fluster me a little</i>
<i>(warm enough that it touches me)</i>

00:22:50.042 --> 00:23:00.458
<i>I wish that what I'm feeling could reach you</i>

00:23:00.458 --> 00:23:10.958
<i>I'm glad just to be at your side</i>

00:23:10.958 --> 00:23:21.375
<i>Under this ever-changing sky, </i>
<i>I want to change as well</i>

00:23:21.375 --> 00:23:31.375
<i>if it means I can </i>
<i>tenderly smile like you someday</i>

00:23:46.792 --> 00:23:49.333
No, you don't have to
be at my side <i>all </i>the time!

00:23:49.333 --> 00:24:08.128
By which I mean, close the door!
